WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Kaleidoscope Sun (1-08)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.800
[Melancholic Keyboard Arpeggio, Flute & Guitar Intro]

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.300
The city sleeps in shades of grey, another dawn begins

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.500
Another street, another day, where no one ever wins

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:57.000
A hollow echo in the square, a promise whispered low

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:08.800
Of somewhere else, beyond compare, a place where true things grow.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:15.400
The faces blur, a passing stream, a river deep and wide

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:23.800
Lost in a half-forgotten dream, where do the lost ones hide?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.500
Do you hear it?

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.500
A whisper on the wind, a melody so clear?

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:37.500
(Oh, the true light gleams...)

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.200
Will you come back?

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:45.000
To where the true light gleams, and home is always near?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:02:00.700
[Poignant 'Safe Harbor' Flute Lifeline Melody]

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.300
We chase the shadows on the wall, illusions that we build

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:16.500
Afraid to leap, afraid to fall, a prophecy fulfilled.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:23.200
The painted smiles, a masquerade, to hide the fading spark

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:31.200
A fragile fortress we have made, against the growing dark.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:38.800
But in the distance, I can see a shimmer in the air

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:48.500
A different kind of mystery, a world beyond compare.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.400
Do you hear it?

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:56.200
A whisper on the wind, a melody so clear?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:02.500
(Oh, the true light gleams...)

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Will you come back?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:12.500
To where the true light gleams, and home is always near?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:20.200
Through fractured prisms, light divides, in patterns sharp and bright

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:28.400
A thousand paths, where fate presides, between the day and night.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:35.600
Is it a vision, just a trace? A trick of weary eyes?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:43.800
Or is there truly such a place, beneath those shifting skies?

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:51.500
A shelter from the endless rain, a refuge from the cold…

00:03:51.800 --> 00:04:01.000
A story waiting to unfold, a legend to be told.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:33.000
[Sweeping Virtuoso Flute Solo]

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.800
Do you hear it?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.000
A whisper on the wind, a melody so clear?

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:48.000
(Oh, the true light gleams...)

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.600
Will you come back?

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:56.000
To where the true light gleams, and home is always near?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:08.000
[Soft Flute Leitmotif & Keyboard Arpeggio Outro]
